<section><h2 class="ref-sec-title">In the profiles</h2><ul class="yr-prof"><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/republic-of-guatemala"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Republic%20of%20Guatemala.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Republic of Guatemala</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Efraín Ríos Montt intensifies the scorched-earth campaign in the highlands</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/argentine-republic"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Argentine%20Republic.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Argentine Republic</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Argentina loses the Falklands War to Britain</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/canada"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Canada.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Canada</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">The Constitution Act patriates the constitution and adds the Charter of Rights and Freedoms</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/cahokia"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Cahokia.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Cahokia</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Cahokia Mounds becomes a UNESCO World Heritage Site</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/culture/hopewell-culture"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Hopewell%20culture.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Hopewell culture</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Ray Hively and Robert Horn publish their study of lunar sightlines at the Newark Earthworks</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/syrian-arab-republic"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Syrian%20Arab%20Republic.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Syrian Arab Republic</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">The Islamist uprising of the Muslim Brotherhood ends in the Hama massacre, in which Ba'athist troops and paramilitaries kill between 2,000 and 40,000 people.</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/ideology/kemalism"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Kemalism.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Kemalism</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">A new constitution after the military coup of 1980 declares the Republic loyal to the nationalism of Atatürk</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/work/terracotta-army"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Terracotta%20Army.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Terracotta Army</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">The first exhibition of the figures outside China opens at the National Gallery of Victoria in Melbourne</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/work/sigiriya"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Sigiriya.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Sigiriya</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">The Cultural Triangle Project began archaeological work on the entire city</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/religion/rastafari"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Rastafari.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Rastafari</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">The first international assembly of Rastafari groups takes place in Toronto, Canada</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/ideology/juche"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Juche.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Juche</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">On the Juche Idea is published under Kim Jong Il's name</span></li></ul></section>
